# Package registries: what `bundle install` and `npm install` reach.
# Profile deps: deps@, and nvim (profiles agent,deps) for its own installs.
#
# One entry per line: a hostname (resolved to IPv4 by the host when the
# container starts), an IPv4 address or CIDR, or meta:github (GitHub's
# published web/api/git ranges). Every port is allowed to a listed address.

rubygems.org
index.rubygems.org
# Gemfile git sources and gem/npm postinstall downloads of release assets.
# github.com covers the case where the published ranges cannot be fetched.
meta:github
github.com
codeload.github.com
objects.githubusercontent.com
release-assets.githubusercontent.com
registry.npmjs.org
